lse,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.6227552\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1157,"kind":"battle","message":"瓦耳拉齐受到 156 点伤害。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.6428244\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1158,"kind":"battle","message":"钟灵施展「罗汉拳」。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.6428269\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1159,"kind":"operation","message":"施展招式：武功 罗汉拳，x 9，y 1","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.6509079\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1160,"kind":"battle","message":"瓦耳拉齐受到 383 点伤害。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.6671638\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1161,"kind":"battle","message":"Wren施展「野球拳」。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.6671665\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1162,"kind":"growth","message":"Wren从8级升至9级。","notice":true,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.6673081\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1163,"kind":"growth","message":"钟灵从5级升至6级。","notice":true,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.6673328\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1164,"kind":"growth","message":"李文秀从8级升至9级。","notice":true,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.6673488\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1165,"kind":"battle","message":"战斗胜利，已按原有规则结算经验和掉落。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.6673690\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1166,"kind":"operation","message":"施展招式：武功 野球拳，x 9，y 1","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.6673898\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1167,"kind":"dialogue","message":"李文秀：That spell... Cardenio? Is that you?","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.6895984\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1168,"kind":"operation","message":"离开战斗","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.6925627\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1169,"kind":"dialogue","message":"瓦耳拉齐：Cardenio was the name I hid behind. Roque Guinart is the man they banished.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.7166319\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1170,"kind":"dialogue","message":"李文秀：Why didn\u0027t you tell me?","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.7440576\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1171,"kind":"dialogue","message":"瓦耳拉齐：I taught you to distrust strangers. I should have taught myself to let old grudges go.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.7596839\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1172,"kind":"dialogue","message":"李文秀：Please. Stay with me.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.7695607\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1173,"kind":"dialogue","message":"瓦耳拉齐：Perez saved you. Remember him for that. As for me... don\u0027t mistake bitterness for wisdom.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.7849989\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1174,"kind":"dialogue","message":"李文秀：My teacher. Father Perez. Gone. I don\u0027t know where to go now.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.8027537\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1175,"kind":"dialogue","message":"主角：You don\u0027t have to decide your whole future today. Just the next stretch of road. We\u0027d be glad to share it.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.8234109\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1176,"kind":"dialogue","message":"李文秀：And what happens when I don\u0027t feel brave?","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.8388063\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1177,"kind":"dialogue","message":"主角：Then one of us carries the bags. That\u0027s what a party is for.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.8517648\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1178,"kind":"dialogue","message":"李文秀：All right. But my horse gets a say in the route.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.8660029\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1179,"kind":"dialogue","message":"主角：Of course. The only one of us with four sensible feet.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.8809751\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1180,"kind":"notice","message":"李文秀 自由属性点 \u002B30","notice":true,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.9027404\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1181,"kind":"notice","message":"李文秀 奇门 \u002B40","notice":true,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.9031519\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1182,"kind":"notice","message":"李文秀 max_hp \u002B500","notice":true,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.9055358\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1183,"kind":"notice","message":"李文秀 max_mp \u002B500","notice":true,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.9055702\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1184,"kind":"item","message":"获得「黑血神针秘籍」×1","notice":true,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.9077646\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1185,"kind":"growth","message":"解锁称号：白马西风","notice":true,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.9121758\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1186,"kind":"notice","message":"李文秀 习得外功【黑血神针】 1级","notice":true,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.9687695\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1187,"kind":"story","message":"已选择修炼秘籍「黑血神针秘籍」。秘籍保留在背包，战斗结算经验将用于此项修炼。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.9692598\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1188,"kind":"operation","message":"选择修炼秘籍：物品编号 9","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.9694776\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1189,"kind":"story","message":"已切换当前运行内功。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.9806992\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1190,"kind":"operation","message":"切换主运内功：武功 基本内功","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.9809835\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1191,"kind":"operation","message":"调整参战顺序：人物 李文秀，选项 1","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:37.9929334\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1192,"kind":"operation","message":"与地点交互：地点 南贤居","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:38.0015614\u002B00:00","mapId":"南贤居"},{"id":1193,"kind":"dialogue","message":"主角：Time to practice together. If we both shout \u0027I\u0027ve got this\u0027, one of us still needs to watch the flank.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:38.0106584\u002B00:00","mapId":"南贤居"},{"id":1194,"kind":"operation","message":"与地点交互：地点 结伴练习","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:38.0107283\u002B00:00","mapId":"南贤居"},{"id":1195,"kind":"battle","message":"进入战斗：结伴练习。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-24T16:17:38.0208582\u002B00:00","mapId":"南贤居"},{"id":1